{"id": "DeivSEPRwp0", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why is he called HANUMAN? 🐒 Because as a baby, he tried to EAT the sun! 🌞🥭\n\nBaby Hanuman woke up hungry. Maa Anjana had gone to pick fruit… and rising over the hills was a big, ripe \"mango\". Son of Vayu, the wind god, he flew straight up. Surya Dev didn't burn him, and he swallowed the sun! Even the Hanuman Chalisa says: \"Yug sahastra yojan par Bhanu, leelyo tahi madhur phal janu.\"\n\nIt was an eclipse day, so Rahu came for the sun, and baby went for HIM too. Then Indra arrived on Airavata, his white elephant: an even BIGGER fruit! Indra's vajra struck the baby's jaw (hanu). Papa Vayu got so angry that he stopped all the air in the world, until Brahma woke the baby and every god gave him a boon. And Indra said: since my vajra hit his hanu, he will be called HANUMAN. 🙏\n\n(Valmiki Ramayana, Kishkindha Kanda & Uttara Kanda)\n\n📚 More stories of our gods, for little ones: rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\nDid you know this story? Comment JAI BAJRANGBALI 🙏 Save it for bedtime, and share it with the little Hanuman of your house who eats EVERYTHING 😄\n\n#hanuman #balhanuman #hanumanji #jaibajrangbali #hanumanchalisa #jaishreeram #ramayana #indianmythology #hindumythology #kidsstories #bedtimestories #sanatandharma #mythologystories #rishikatha #animation", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792127164, "like_count": 37444, "comment_count": 204, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1646341700008948a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 45.413, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNRU6-iDmY33daUbePXAtTXDhcm6SRslHi_T-fVzSSmzn1qihAS5dnygNUV6CmwMk0-49DKzuCGgjwEhIjSvOGJx1yhYtknH8BaQtQ.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrTwB_kGPkrPzQ46FQvEyjRM5j2mOxwtq2Uvi8JVexsNzF0Sk_WywgHU708